---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /columns/
title: 營養師專欄
excerpt: 認識口袋營養獅的營養師們，以及他們的專欄文章。
---
{%- import "macros.njk" as ui -%}
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    {{ ui.heading("COLUMNISTS", "營養師專欄", "每一篇文章，都看得到是誰寫的") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tight">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="team-row">
      {%- for m in collections.team %}
      <a class="member-card reveal" href="{{ m.url }}">
        <span class="member-stage"><img class="buddy-img" src="{{ m.data.avatar }}" alt="{{ m.data.name }}插畫" loading="lazy"></span>
        <span class="member-name">{{ m.data.name }}</span>
        <span class="member-greet">{{ (collections.articles | where("author", m.data.id)).length }} 篇文章</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if collections.columns.length %}
<section class="section section-alt">
  {{ ui.wave("#FDF3E4", true) }}
  <div class="container">
    {{ ui.heading("SERIES", "專欄系列") }}
    <div class="column-grid">
      {%- for c in collections.columns %}
      {%- set owner = collections.team | findBy("id", c.data.author) -%}
      <a class="card column-card reveal" href="{{ c.url }}">
        {% if owner %}<img class="column-avatar" src="{{ owner.data.avatar }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% endif %}
        <div>
          <h3 class="card-title">《{{ c.data.name }}》</h3>
          {% if owner %}<p class="card-author">{{ owner.data.name }}</p>{% endif %}
          <p class="card-excerpt">{{ c.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ ui.wave("#FFFAF2") }}
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <div class="note-band reveal">
      <p class="note-title">每篇文章都附上</p>
      <ul class="note-list">
        <li>撰文營養師與署名</li><li>發布與更新日期</li><li>參考資料</li><li>「不能取代醫療診斷」提醒</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
